314	  // Stop is a real cancel, not a UI-only one: aborting the fetch closes the
315	  // response body, which fires cancel() on the route's ReadableStream, which
316	  // aborts the model request server-side. The build row is then written FAILED
317	  // with creditsCharged: 0 — nothing is billed. See BuildInterrupted.tsx.
318	  function stop() {
